        "Title": "Whittleton Noise Complaint",
        "Location": "LOCATION_NORTHAMERICA",
        "PublicId": "122557642034",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/skunk/scene_skunk.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 5f307b57-55e8-4f56-97f3-397df9e3dd96).Image",
        "Description": "Things have been a little too loud and annoying in Whittleton Creek for Janus lately, and he&apos;d like some people who are far too aware of him and his activities removed.\r\rJames Batty, the man suing him for helicopter use to and from his Ark Society meetings.\r\rHelen West, who has done work on his Ark Society robes and now knows too much.\r\rFinally, Nelson Lafayette, his nurse may have over heard some things he should not know.\r\rHe doesn&apos;t want any more excitement, so keep a low profile on this one.",
